---
source: crates/biome_css_parser/tests/spec_test.rs
expression: snapshot
---

## Input

```css
.whole { color: if(#{"style(--status: complete)"}: red; else: blue); next: retained; }
.parenthesized { color: if((#{"style(--status: complete)"}): red; else: blue); next: retained; }
.negated { color: if(not #{"style(--status: complete)"}: red; else: blue); next: retained; }
.left { color: if(#{"style(--status: complete)"} and style(--enabled: true): red; else: blue); next: retained; }
.right { color: if(style(--enabled: true) or #{"style(--status: complete)"}: red; else: blue); next: retained; }
.legacy { color: if(#{true}, white, black); next: retained; }
.native { color: if(style(--status: complete): red; else: blue); }
.after { display: block; }

```


